# 2026-08-12 21:47:56.882577
+We are redesigning our Shopify theme homepage to match the high-converting, minimalist luxury aesthetic of Monday Swimwear (mondayswimwear.com). 
+
+Please analyze our theme configuration in templates/index.json and sections/ directory, and help us restructure the homepage sections in this specific order:
+
+1. HERO SECTION: Full-width, immersive lifestyle image/video banner with minimal, clean typography and a high-contrast CTA button.
+2. CATEGORY PILLS / EDIT GRID: A sleek grid highlighting collections (e.g., "The Signature Collection", "New Arrivals", "Resort Wear") rather than standard rows, utilizing high-end editorial styling.
+3. FEATURED PRODUCTS WITH QUICK ADD: A product grid layout that supports quick-add size selectors directly on the thumbnails to minimize mobile friction.
+4. LIFESTYLE / EDITORIAL BREAK: A full-width macro texture or "vacation association" split section to build brand aspiration.
+
+Do not break existing schema settings. Write or update the necessary JSON sections and liquid code to achieve this layout framework.

