# 2026-08-12 22:46:25.312874
+Refactor main-product.liquid to mirror Joah Brown's PDP architecture:
+
+1. Desktop Grid:
+   - 60% Left Column: Vertical continuous scroll media gallery. Images stacked vertically with 10px spacing, no carousel arrows, no thumbnail navigation underneath.
+   - 40% Right Column: Sticky buy module (position: sticky, top: 100px).
+2. Variant Selectors (Size & Color):
+   - Replace default dropdown selects with square tile buttons.
+   - Tiles: 0px border-radius, 1px solid #E5E5E5 border, padding: 10px 16px, uppercase text. Selected state: Solid black (#111111) background with white text.
+3. Pricing & Call-to-Action Stack:
+   - Product Title: Uppercase, 18px font-size, letter-spacing: 0.15em.
+   - 'ADD TO CART' button: Full-width (100%), sharp rectangle, black background, uppercase text.
+   - Remove or hide third-party dynamic checkout buttons ('Buy with Shop Pay') to preserve the clean monochrome look.
+4. Collapsible Accordions:
+   - Add clean accordion accordions below the buy button for 'FIT & FABRIC', 'SHIPPING & RETURNS', and 'CARE INSTRUCTIONS' using minimalist 1px divider lines.

# 2026-08-12 23:22:43.818941
+Add the following CSS rules to the very bottom of assets/base.css:
+
+/* JOAH BROWN GLOBAL OVERRIDES */
+*, *::before, *::after, .button, .card, .card__inner, .field__input {
+  border-radius: 0px !important;
+  box-shadow: none !important;
+}
+
+h1, h2, h3, h4, .button, .card__heading {
+  text-transform: uppercase !important;
+  letter-spacing: 0.15em !important;
+  font-weight: 500 !important;
+}
+
+.card__media, .media {
+  aspect-ratio: 3 / 4 !important;
+  object-fit: cover !important;
+  border-radius: 0px !important;
+}
+
+.card__heading, .price {
+  font-size: 11px !important;
+}
+
+.button, .button--primary {
+  background-color: #111111 !important;
+  color: #FFFFFF !important;
+  border: 1px solid #111111 !important;
+}
+
+.accordion-divider {
+  border-top: 1px solid #E5E5E5 !important;
+  margin-top: 1.5rem !important;
+}
+
+.accordion-item {
+  border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E5E5 !important;
+}
+
+.accordion-summary {
+  padding: 1rem 0 !important;
+  cursor: pointer !important;
+  display: flex !important;
+  justify-content: space-between !important;
+  align-items: center !important;
+}
+
+.accordion-summary h3 {
+  margin: 0 !important;
+  font-size: 11px !important;
+}
+
+.accordion-content {
+  padding: 0.8rem 0 1rem 0 !important;
+  font-size: 12px !important;
+  line-height: 1.6 !important;
+  color: #444444 !important;
+}

